"}},{"id":"app-ErrExpectedIdentifierArg-Name","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Expected identifier name"}},"properties":{"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrIncompatibleTypesForEquality-Left-Right","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Incompatible types for comparison. These types can't be compared: {0}, {1}."}},"properties":{"howToFix":["You might need to convert the value to be the same type, such as converting a date string (e.g., \"12/31/2018\") to a date value.","If you're comparing records or tables, the field or column types must match exactly."],"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrIncompatibleCtxtVariableTypes","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Incompatible type. We can't evaluate your formula because the context variable types are incompatible with the types of values in other places in your app."}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Look at places where you use a context variable and make sure that the type (e.g., text, number, date, record, table) is compatible."],"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"app-ErrBadType-ExpectedType-ProvidedType","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Invalid argument type ({1}). Expecting a {0} value instead."}},"properties":{"whyFix":"","level":"High","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"formula"}},{"id":"acc-FocusBorderShouldBeVisible","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Focus isn't showing"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Change the FocusedBorderThickness property to be more than 0."],"whyFix":"If the focus isn't visible, people who don't use a mouse won't be able to see it when they're interacting with the app.","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"accessibility"}},{"id":"acc-TabIndexShouldBeDefinedForInteractiveControl","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Missing tab stop"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Set TabIndex to 0 or greater to ensure that interactive elements have a tab stop."],"whyFix":"People who use the keyboard with your app will not be able to access this element without a tab stop.","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"accessibility"}},{"id":"acc-AccessibleLabelNeeded","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Missing accessible label"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Edit the accessible label property to describe the item."],"whyFix":"If there's no accessible text, people who can’t see the screen won't understand what’s in images and controls.","level":"Medium","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"accessibility"}},{"id":"app-CollectingReadOnlyTable","messageStrings":{"issue":{"text":"Collection is initialized but never updated"}},"properties":{"howToFix":["Replace the Collect or ClearCollect with a named formula on App.Formulas. For example, MyTable = Filter(source, condition). Named formulas are computed when their inputs change and do not carry the tracking cost of a collection."],"whyFix":"Collections are meant to be updated. Power Apps does extra work to keep track of every collection so that anything depending on it stays in sync when the data changes. When the data never changes after it is set, that tracking work is wasted. A named formula gives the same data without the extra cost.","componentType":"app","primaryCategory":"performance","level":"Medium"}}]}},"invocations":[{"executionSuccessful":true}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits"}]}